_jira` scan snapshot labels, and `orphaned_bindings` is classifier-driven off a `JiraObservation` PRESENT/ABSENT decision. Assigning Jira-snapshot-dependent observables to the no-Jira-client owner is a mechanism-correctness gap the matrix does not resolve.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fd08ef5c46f904c52","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach step 2 (bridge fsck bullet) and Scope; AC line 'bridge fsck exposes orphaned-binding, orphaned-Jira, unbound-count ... diagnostics'","norm_id":"nf751834d8db594e2","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Implementer wires orphaned_jira/unbound_jira into fsck's json contract, then must either give fsck a Jira client (breaking its offline L9 boundary) or emit empty/incorrect counts","A held-out fsck test that runs offline can never reproduce the Jira-dependent observables, so characterization 'proves' a hollow migration"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.2222,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"no","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}}],"impact_model_version":"plan-v5","material_fingerprint":"50b9a7fb5add6559","material_parts":{"children":["647ea21